                "url": "https://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2025-10/the-child-has-got-frostbite-what-to-do.webp?itok=-Hn6FJCr",
                "name": "The child has got frostbite - what to do.png",
