            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-04-22T18:57:51+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 04/22/2025 - 18:57\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T02:30:24+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 02:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Play and interact with your toddler, talk and read, ways to read.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003EPlay and interact with your toddler\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-1.webp?itok=W-eXivu_\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 1\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETalk to your toddler about what he is doing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-2.webp?itok=xG4qxhqN\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 2\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPoint out letters in words you and your toddler see around you.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-3.webp?itok=QePV0lJQ\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 3\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMake your own music – sing and dance together!\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ETalk and read\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-4.webp?itok=spi4wk2x\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 4\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETell the same stories and rhymes over and over again.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-5.webp?itok=q8SMlUne\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 5\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EName the pictures your toddler points to in the book.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-6.webp?itok=rKX-nYlE\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 6\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPack books when you go out.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWays to read\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-7.webp?itok=hhgeT3zK\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 7\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETurn the pages together.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-8.webp?itok=IIQEU_BX\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 8\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou don’t have to finish a book – a few pages is great!\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reading-with-your-toddler-pip-9.webp?itok=7q4jZOOI\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Reading with your toddler 9\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJoin in activities at the library – it’s free.\u003C/p\u003E",
