            "id": 2266,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Kubatana ganda-neganda pakarepo mushure mekuzvara",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-02-28T21:46:32+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ESat, 02/28/2026 - 21:46\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T02:30:24+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 02:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Kubatana pakati paamai nemwana ane hutano achangoberekwa pakarepo mushure mekuberekwa chinhu chakakosha uye chinodiwa zvikuru. Zvinoita kuti zvive nyore kuti mwana ajairane nemamiriro ekunze, zvinokurudzira kuvapo kwehukama hwepedyo pakati paamai nemwana uye kutanga kuyamwisa kwakanaka uye kunobudirira.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmai vauya zvakare!\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKuburikidza neganda, mwana achangoberekwa anonzwa kudziya kwemuviri wenyu nekubata kwenyu; anonzwa sekunge ari kumbundirwa. Anonzwa inzwi renyu raakajaira uye kurova kwemoyo wenyu — ruzha rwaakange atojaira achiri mudumbu. Anotarisana nemi mumaziso. Kutarisana kwemaziso kekutanga pakati paamai nemwana inguva yakakosha zvikuru, kukosha kwayo hakugoni kutsanangurwa zvakakwana. Iyi inguva yausingazombokanganwi. Manzwiro ari panguva iyi akadzama zvikuru, uye kazhinji ndiwo anosimbisa sarudzo yaamai yekuyamwisa mwana.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKubatana kwemuviri (Body contact)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKubatana kwemwana nemuviri waamai kunonyaradza amai nemwana vese. Kunobatsira kugadzirisa kurova kwemoyo wemwana nekufema kwake, uye kunomuchengeta achidziya kuburikidza nekudziya kwemuviri waamai. Kubatana uku kunobatsirawo:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKugadzirisa uye kugadzikisa kushanda kwe metabolism yemwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKugadzikisa chiyero cheshuga yemuropa remwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKudzivirira kuchema kwemwana, zvichideredza kushushikana nekushandiswa kwesimba rakawandisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuti mwana atange kugamuchira utachiona (bacteria) hunobatsira kubva kuna amai (anovaka masoja ekudzivirira chirwere).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKusimbisa hukama (bond) pakati paamai nemwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKubatsira mwana kutsvaga zamu uye kubata zvakanaka pakuyamwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EZvinokurudzirwa\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKubatana kunofanira kuitwa nekukasika \u003Cstrong\u003E,\u003C/strong\u003E kunyangwe tambo yerukuvhute isati yachekwa, kana nekukurumidza sezvinobvira mumaminitsi mashoma ekutanga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENguva yekubatana inofanira kunge iri awa imwe chete (1hour).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKana pakaitwa operation (caesarean section) nespinal/epidural anesthesia zvinobvumirawo kuti mwana abatane ganda neganda nguva pfupi mushure mekusununguka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKana operation ikaitwa negeneral anesthesia, mwana anogona kubatana ganda neganda nababa pakarepo mushure mekuzvarwa, uye ozobatana ganda neganda naamai mushure mekunge vamuka (mumaawa mashoma anotevera).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKana vari mapatya, mwana wokutanga anogona kuramba akabatana muviri naamai kusvikira kutanga kwekuberekwa kwemwana wechipiri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EMaitiro ekubatana ganda neganda\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMwana asina kupfeka anoiswa pachipfuva  nepadumbu paamai vake vasina kupfeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMwana anogona kupukutwa asati apedza izvi kuti akurudzirwe kufema nekuchema.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMwana anoiswa padumbu raamai vake, maoko ake akavhurika, makumbo ake akapatsanuka zvishoma uye akakombama zvishoma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMwana anofanira kupfeka ngowani uye kufukidzwa netauro \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMhuno nemuromo hazvifanirwe kuvharwa, musoro unotaridzwa parutivi, mutsipa wakatwasuka pasina kupfugamira mberi, kuitira kuti nzira inofamba nemweya wekufema dzigare dzakavhurika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana muchinetseka kuti muchanzwa kuneta mushure mekusununguka, munofanira kuziva kuti hapana chinokunyaradzai uye chinokufadzai kupfuura kubatana padhuze nemwana wenyu! Kana muchinetseka kuti mwana angangovata, munofanira kuziva kuti mumaawa  ekutanga mushure mekuzvarwa, mwana ari muchimiro chekumuka, manzwiro ake ekunhuwidza nekuravira akasimba, uye akagadzirira kuyamwa. Kana muchinetseka nezvehutano hwemwana wenyu, munofanira kuziva kuti vashandi vezveutano vemuimba yekusunungukira vari kukutarisai pamwe nekutarisa mwana wenyu zvakanaka.\u003C/p\u003E",
