            "id": 8476,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Kuputa, kushandisa e-cigarettes (vaping) uye pamuviri: mifananidzo",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-01-05T22:06:29+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EMon, 01/05/2026 - 22:06\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T02:30:24+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 02:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Kuputa kana kushandisa e-cigarette : pamuviri\n  \n      \n  \n    Image",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuputa kana kushandisa e-cigarette : pamuviri\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-1.gif?itok=yBwX4aXl\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-1\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana imi kana mudiwa wenyu muchiputa kana muchishandisa e-cigarette, zvinogona kunetsa kubata pamuviri.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-2.gif?itok=nxpdvrzL\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-2\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana muchiputa kana kushandisa e-cigarette (vaping) pamunenge muine pamuviri,, mwana wenyu anenge achiputawo nekushandisa e-cigarette.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-3-2024.gif?itok=u3gDXSbX\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-3\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana mukafema utsi hwevamwe vanhu kana mhepo pamunenge mune pamuviri, hutsi uhwuu kana mhepo hunoenda kumwana wenyu.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuputa kana kushandisa e-cigarette mune pamuviri: zvinokuvadza mwana wenyu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-4.gif?itok=cFvwBG4z\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-4\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUtsi hwezvinoputwa ne vaping hune  mishonga inechepfu akaita se nicotine. Mishona iyi inogona kuwedzera njodzi yekubva pamuviri, kufa kwemwana asati azvarwa (stillbirth), kuzvarwa nguva isati yakwana (premature birth) kana kurema huremu hushoma hwemwana pakuzvarwa (low birth weight).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-5.gif?itok=SPzEriUg\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-5\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENicotine uye mimwe mishonga inowanikwa muchiutsi chezvinoputwa  zvinogona kukuvadza huropi nemapapu emwana wenyu nekuwedzera njodzi ye asthma, zvirwere zvevana, uye kuzvara mwana ane mhino nemuromo wakatsemuka(cleft lip and palate).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-pregnancy-7-2024_0.gif?itok=iVU_iDLe\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-6\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKufa kwemwana kusingatarisirwi (Sudden Unexpected Death in Infancy – SUDI) kunowanikwa zvakanyanya kuvana vanozvarwa nemadzimai anoputa uye kushandisa e-cigarette dzine nicotine panguva yepamuviri kana mushure mekusununguka.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKurega kuputa uye vaping: zvakakunakirai imi nemwana wenyu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-7.gif?itok=_-aSiTcY\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-7\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKuputa kana kushandisa e- cigarette kunogona kuderedza kuwanda kwemukaka uye kuisa zvinhu zvinokuvadza mumukaka wenyu wemuzamu. Asi kunyangwe uchiputa kana kushandisa e-cigarette, kuyamwisa mwana chichiri chinhu chakanakisisa kumwana wenyu. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-8.gif?itok=pO3C-Hj-\" width=\"557\" height=\"466\" alt=\"smoking-and-pregnancy-pip-8\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHapana nguva inonzi manonoka kuregedza kuputa.  Semuenzaniso, awa imwe mushure mekunge marega, njodzi yematambudziko epamuviri uye yekurwara kwemwana wenyu inodzika.\u003C/p\u003E",
