            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Zviratidzo zvinoitwa nevana vacheche nendumurwa: mumifananidzo",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-11-12T09:46:26+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EWed, 11/12/2025 - 09:46\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T02:30:24+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 02:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Zviratidzo zvemwana mucheche: 'Ndinoda kutariswa' \"Mother making eye contact with her baby. \"",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003EMaitiro emucheche: 'Ndinoda kutariswa'\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/eye-contact.webp?itok=DJIOPzD9\" width=\"316\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Baby cues 1\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKukutarisa mumaziso ndiyo imwe nzira iyo mwana wako anokuudza kuti arikuda kutererwa.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/baby-turn.webp?itok=I0burTT2\" width=\"316\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Baby cues 2\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMwana wako anogona kutendeutsa musoro wake okutarisa kana achida kutererwa.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/reach-out.webp?itok=KGyiyBb0\" width=\"316\" height=\"267\" alt=\"Baby cues 3\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMwana wako anogona kukubata, kurezva kana kuita ruzha  kuti umuterere.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EManzwi emucheche: 'Ndinoda kuzorora kana shanduko chiito'\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/baby-turn-head.webp?itok=OnL90bl_\" width=\"312\" height=\"268\" alt=\"Baby cues 4\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMwana wako anogona kutendeutsira musoro wake kure newe kana achida kuzorora kana kuchinja zvirikuitwa.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/baby-arch-back.webp?itok=wT3RNe2j\" width=\"313\" height=\"268\" alt=\"Baby cues 5\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMwana wako anogona kukotamisa musana wake kana kuchema kana achida kuzorora.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/smiling_0.webp?itok=MM0PQqiT\" width=\"321\" height=\"264\" alt=\"Baby cues 6\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana mwana wako achida kuzorora, edza kumuisa pasi kuti atambe kana kumurarisa kana iri nguva yekurara.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EZviratidzo zvekuti mwana aneta\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/baby-yawning.webp?itok=4fceNPuD\" width=\"316\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Baby cues 7\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKana mwana wako achishama n`ai, achipukuta maziso ake kana kutambisa maoko kana makumbo, izvi zviratidzo zvekuneta.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/older-babies-and-toddlers.webp?itok=QagOzVq0\" width=\"315\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Baby cues 8\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVana vakura uye ndumurwa vanogona  kuchema kana vachida kutererwa\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/quiet-time-in-bed.webp?itok=l1t2Oh3J\" width=\"318\" height=\"265\" alt=\"Baby cues 9\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEdza kupa mwana wako nguva yakanyarara ari pamubhedha kuti agadzirire kurara.\u003C/p\u003E",
