            "id": 8681,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Kumaviki angu 3 uzithwele",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-23T16:55:21+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ESun, 08/23/2026 - 16:55\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-09-10T13:45:16+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 09/10/2026 - 13:45\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Kumhlahlandlela wethu wokukhulelwa weviki leviki, ungathola ukuthi yini ongayilindela uma ulamaviki angu-3 uzithwele.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKumaviki angu-3 uzithwele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIqanda (ngezinye izikhathi angu-2 kumbe kusedlula, nxa uzithwele abantwana abanengi) lehla ngetshubhu lakho le-fallopian lisiya esibelethweni sakho. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAmazinga akho e-\u003Cem\u003Eprogesterone\u003C/em\u003E ayaqansa manje. Le-\u003Cem\u003Ehormone\u003C/em\u003E yenza umzimba wakho wazi ukuthi uzithwele, okubangela ukuthi isibeletho sakho siqale ukwakha lapho esizagcinela ezomsoco, lokhu kwenza ume ukuya esikhathini.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmntwana wakho\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUsuku lwesi-14 kulapho ukuzithwala okwenzeka khona. Ngosuku lwesi-15, umntwana uyabe eselamaseli amabili kuphela kodwa uyakhula ngaso sonke isikhathi. Ngosuku lwesi-17, kulamaseli ayi-16.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENgosuku lwesi-18, umntwana uyilokho esikubiza ngokuthi 'i-blastocyst', uhleli kudonga lwesibeletho sakho ngosuku lwesi-20.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://raisingchildren.net.au/__data/assets/image/0031/34897/pregnancy-w3.jpg\" alt=\"umfanekiso wokukhulelwa, isonto lesi-3\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 441,
            "category": 436,
            "subcategory": 8616,
            "child_age": [701],
            "child_gender": 716,
            "parent_gender": 3396,
