            "title": "Amaviki angu-15 uzithwele",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-21T12:54:29+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 08/21/2026 - 12:54\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-09-10T14:00:33+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 09/10/2026 - 14:00\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Kugwalo lwethu olulezifundiso zokuzithwala ngeviki leviki, ungathola imfundiso ngokukhangelelwe kumaviki angu-15.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWena ulamaviki angu-15 uzithwele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmzimba wakho usumpompa igazi elinengi emzimbeni ukwedlula okujwayelekileyo. Inhliziyo yakho isisebenza ngamandla kakhulu. Lokhu kungakwenza ube \u003Cstrong\u003Elokukhazimula kokuzithwala\u003C/strong\u003E, kodwa kungahambisana lezinye izinguquko:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukutshiswelwa loba ukugodola\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukuphuma umungula\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eukutshaywa likhanda kancane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa utshaywa likhanda khakhulu kumbe okungapheliyo, vakatshela abazempilakahle abaseduze lawe kumbe ubone udokotela kumbe umongikazi obelethisayo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInwele zakho zingabe sezikhule zibe zagcwale, njalo izinzipho zakho zingakhula masinyane.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa udinga ukuhlolwa okunika ulwazi oluqakathekileyo ngempilakahle yomntwana ngenxa yezizatho zempilakahle, kungenziwa kusukela emavikini angu-15..\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://raisingchildren.net.au/__data/assets/image/0028/34957/pregnancy-w15.jpg\" alt=\"pregnancy illustration, week 15\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImuli yakho\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKujayelekile ukucabanga \u003Cstrong\u003Engabazali bakho\u003C/strong\u003E, indima abayidlalayo empilweni yakho ngesikhathi usakhula, kanye lendlela wena ongaba ngumzali ngayo. Nxa imuli yakho ihlala khatshana lawe kumbe umuntu oqakathekileyo kuwe engasekho, ungazizwa ukuthi akakho ngesikhathi uzithwele.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUkuzithwala kungasondeza imuli ndawonye. Ungafisa ukuchitha isikhathi esinengi lemuli yakho. Kanengi lokhu kuba yikuthakazelela ndawonye ukuthi uzithwele kumbe ukulindela ngenjabulo umntwana omutsha ozazalwa emulini.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbanye abantu bakhetha ukungabi lemuli zabo empilweni yabo. Ungaqala ukuqaphela kakhulu imizwa yakho mayelana lezinto ezinzima ezake zenzakala empilweni yakho, njalo ukuzithwala kungavusa imicabango lemizwa eqinileyo kumbe ebuhlungu.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa lokhu kufanana lalokho okwenzakala kuwe, kungaba kuhle \u003Cstrong\u003Eukukhuluma lomuntu omthembayo kumbe uthole uncedo kwabazempilakahle\u003C/strong\u003E. Ungakhuluma lodokotela kumbe umongikazi obelethisayo. Izibhedlela ezinengi zilezisebenzi zempilakahle yengqondo ezinganika ukwesekwa lokwelulekwa.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EImihlangano yakho yokuhlolwa ngesikhathi sokuzithwala ikunikeza ithuba lokukhuluma ngempilakahle yakho, indlela ophila ngayo kanye lokuphila kwakho kuhle, kokubili emzimbeni lasemizweni. Nxa ukhathazekile ngokuba ngumzali kumbe kulobunzima ebudlelwaneni bakho, okugoqela udlakela emulini, kungaba kuhle ukuthi ukhulume langalokhu. Eqinisweni, inengi lezindawo ezinika ukunakekelwa ngesikhathi sokuzithwala ziyakubuza ngodlakela lwasekhaya ngesikhathi uzithwele. Lokhu kwenzelwa ukuthi uthole ukwesekwa nxa ukudinga.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmntwana wakho nxa usulamaviki angu-15 uzithwele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmntwana wakho usethola isisindo masinyane:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana usele-\u003Cstrong\u003E9.5 cm\u003C/strong\u003E kusukela ekhanda kusiya ezansi komzimba, njalo usesinda  i\u003Cstrong\u003E80 g\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmzimba womntwana wakho khathesi usukhula masinyane ukwedlula ikhanda lakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana wakho angabe eseqala ukumunya isithupha sakhe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzinwele ezincane kakhulu, seziqala ukuphuma emzimbeni womntwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 441,
            "category": 436,
            "subcategory": 8621,
            "child_age": [701],
            "child_gender": 716,
            "parent_gender": 3396,
            "keywords": [],
            "meta_keywords": "",
