            "id": 8376,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Ukuzizwa ukhathazekile enqondweni omunye wakho ezithwele",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-19T14:57:04+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EWed, 08/19/2026 - 14:57\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-20T07:43:11+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 08/20/2026 - 07:43\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Inguquko ebakhona ngokuzithwala sokungabangela ukukhathazeka enqondweni kuwe lakomunye wakho. Nxa ungathola indlela ezifaneleyo zokunqoba lokhu kukhathazeka sokungaba yinto enhle emntwaneni lakumlingani wakho. ",
            "body": "\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKungani ungazizwa ukhathazekile enqodweni ngesikhathi umlingane wakho ezithwele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUhambo lokuzithwala lokuba ngumzali kuletha izinguquko ezinengi – kwesinye isikhathi zonke  lezinguquko zibuya ndawonye.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENgokwesibonelo, ngesikhathi uzithwele ungazizwa ukhathazekile ngezinto ezifana lokuphatha imali, umsebenzi, izinkinga ebudlelwaneni kumbe ukungazwani emulini.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFuthi ungazizwa ukhathazekile ngenxa yokuthi kuningi okufanele ukufunde ngokunakekela umntwana omutsha, lokuthi lokhu kuzathinta kanjani isikhathi sakho, ubudlelwano bakho labanye.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhathazeka enqondweni kungamthinta kanjani umlingane wakho lomntwana\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUngacabanga ukuthi uyakwazi ukuqoba ukukhathazeka  kwakho kumbe ukuthi akuthinti abanye. Kodwa kungaphuma kubonakale ebudlelwaneni bakho labanye abantu. Ungazithola usuzonda masinyane kumbe usuphikisana lomlingane wakho kanengi.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa unatha utshwala, ukubhema kumbe ezinye izidakamizwa ukuze ubhekane lokukhathazeka kwakho, ungazithola usekwenza kakhulu okwedlula okujwayeleyo. Lokhu kungabangela ukungazwani okukhulu phakathi kwakho lomlingane wakho labanye abantu.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUma umlingane ozithweleyo ekhathazekile kakhulu, lokhu kungathinta impilo lokukhula komntwana ngaphambi kokuzalwa langemva kokuzalwa.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkukhangelana lokukhathazeka enqondweni ngesikhathi umlingane wakho ezithwele\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUkuthola izindlela zokhangelana lokumelana lokukhathazeka kuqakathekile kuwe umlingane kanye lomntwana.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUkukhuluma ngezinto ezikuhlukuluzayo kulinyathelo elihle. Ungakhuluma lomlingane wakho kumbe umuntu omthembayo. Lokhu kunganciphisa ukucindezeleka kwakho futhi kukusize uqonde izinkinga uthole lezixazululo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENgokwesibonelo, nxa ukhathazekile ngemali, ungabuza abanye abazali ukuthi bakhangelana njani lalokhu. Bangakunika amacebo alusizo. Njalo ungafunda ngoncedo ongaluthola  kuhulumende ezingakusiza ngemva kokubeletha.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuzinakekela ukuze unciphise ukucindezeleka :\u003C/strong\u003EUnganciphisa ukukhathazeka enqondweni ngokunakekela impilo yakho:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDlana ukudla okulemisoco\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eyenza imisebenzi lemidlalo elula lokuqinisa umzimba\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPhumula okwanele\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYenza izinto ozithandayo ezokuzilibazisa\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKungcono ukuma izinto ezihlukumisa umzimba kakhulu njengegwayi lecaffeine, kanye lezidambisi ezifana lotshwala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbanye abazali abazalayo bazizwa bengacindezelekanga kakhulu nxa befunda ngabakulindeleyo ngesikhathi sozithwala lokuba ngumzali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUngakwenza lokhu ngokuthi:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFunda ngezomntwana omutsha\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBala amabhuku okukhulisa abantwana\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhuluma lomlingane wakho, imuli kumbe abangane asebengabazali\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHamba ezifundweni zokukhulelwa \u003Cem\u003E(antenatal classes)\u003C/em\u003E kumbe ezokumunyisa (\u003Cem\u003Ebreastfeeding classes)\u003C/em\u003E, kumbe uzifunde ku-internet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa ungakhangelana, umelane lokukhathazeka kwakho kuhle kumbe udabuka kumbe uthukuthelela lomlingane wakho kumbe abanye abantu, kuyinto enhle ukucela usizo. Ungakhuluma labezempilakahle nxa ufuna usizo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKwabanye abantu, ukudkhathazeka kungabangela ekuthukuthela lodlame. Udlame kalulunganga. Nxa ukukhathazeka kwakho kubangela ukuzonda lokulwa, kuqakathekile ukuthola usizo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 441,
            "category": 446,
            "subcategory": 8636,
