            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Ukunakekela labo abanakekela abantwana",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-07-16T09:24:53+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 07/16/2026 - 09:24\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-18T13:05:45+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 08/18/2026 - 13:05\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Njengoba ukunakekela ngokunanzelela kusekelwa yimizwa, ukungaphili kahle kwengqondo kuyaphambanisa ukondla lokunakekela abantwana. Ukunakekela kudinga ukunanzelela izidingo zomzimba, ingqondo lemizwa zalabo abanakekela abantwana.",
            "body": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkunakekela labo abanakekela abantwana\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E Ukondla lokunakekela umntwana kuyinto enzima eletha ukukhathazeka (\u003Cem\u003Estress\u003C/em\u003E) yona yodwa ,lokhu kukhathazeka kungengezelelwa ngeminye imilandu umzali alayo efana lomsebenzi lemisebenzi yangekhaya. Kuqakathekile ukuthi abanakekela abantwana ndawonye lemuli yonke bahlele kuhle imsebenzi yabo ukuze abantwana bathole ukuvikeleka lokunakekelwa okwaneleyo. Imihlobo yonke yobudlwangudlwangu ngekhaya kumele yenqatshelwe, ngoba ilakho ukwenza ingekhaya ibe yindawo engalungelanga intuthuko lempilakahle yomntwana engqondweni. Abazali lalabo abanakekela abantwana kufanele bananzelele ukuthi basebenza imisebenzi ebanika ithuba elaneleyo lokunakekela imuli\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmacebo angasiza abazali\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana engakazalwa, xoxisana lomunye wakho livumelane ngokuthi imisebenzi yangekhaya (lomsembenzi) kuzenziwa njani nxa umntwana sezelwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZinike ithuba lokuvakatsha uzinakelele: umkakho (labanye abemuli) kufanele bakusekele bancedise ukuze wenelise ukwenza lokhu\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbesilisa labesifazane abanakekela abantwana bakhuthazwa ukuthi bancedisane ekunakeleni abantwana lasekwenzeni imisebenzi yangekhaya ngokulinganayo. Abesilisa labesifazane abanakekela abantwana kufanele baphatheke emisebenzini yangekhaya ngokwesintu eyenziwa ngobunye ubulili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbanakekela abantwana kufanele baphatheke emaqenjini okondla abantwana, kuzifundo zokondla abantwana; badinge usekelo kokuphathelane lempilakahle yengqondo lokuphilisana labanye nxa kudingeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbaqhatshi lohulumende welizwe bayakuthazwa ukubumba lokusekela imithetho ekhuthaza ukunakekelwa kwezimuli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImihlobo yonke yobudlwangudlwangu ngemakhaya kufanele ivikelwe njalo ibikwe kwabezomthetho: abanakekela abantwana bayakhuthazwa ukudinga usizo ngezidingo zokunakekela kwabaqeqetshileyo nxa kudingeka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZinakekele engqondweni lasemoyeni, uthole isikhathi sokuvakatsha okugoqela ukwenza imisebenzi lemidlalo eqinisa umzimba lokuthatha isikhathi labangane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 0,
            "category": 411,
            "subcategory": 0,
            "child_age": [641, 646, 651, 656, 661, 666, 671, 676, 681, 686, 691, 696],
