            "title": " Ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo ngemva kokuhlinzwa (VBAC)",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-07-10T09:11:31+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 07/10/2026 - 09:11\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-07-30T13:30:38+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 07/30/2026 - 13:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Kubomama abanengi ababelethayo, ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo ngemva kokuhlinzwa, kumbe i-VBAC, kuyindlela ephephileyo yokuthola umntwana. I-VBAC ifana lokubeletha ngendlela yemvelo, ngaphandle kokuthi ngesikhathi uhelelwa uzabe unakekelwa ngokunanzelela okukhulu.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003EKuyini ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo ngemva kokuhlinzwa (i-VBAC)?\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbesifazane abake babeletha ngokuhlinzwa (caesarean section) bavame ukwenelisa ukuzama ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo ngesikhathi esilandelayo. Lokhu kubizwa ngokuthi yi-\u003Cem\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Evaginal birth after caesarean\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003E(VBAC)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EVBAC ihamba njani?\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI-VBAC ifana kakhulu lokubeletha ngendlela yemvelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmehluko kuphela yikuthi ngesikhathi sokubeletha, \u003Cstrong\u003Eodokotela kanye lomongikazi\u003C/strong\u003E bazakuhlola ngokunanzelela kakhulu kulanxa ungakaze uhlinzwe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBangasebenzisa imitshina yokuhlola impilo yakho kanye leyomntwana ngesikhathi sokubeletha. Lokhu kwenziwa ukuze bathole masinyane nxa kukhona inkinga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa konke kuhamba kuhle, uzakwazi ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo. Kodwa nxa kukhona izizathu zempilakahle ezingakuvumeliyo, udokotela kumbe umongikazi uzakweluleka ukuthi ubelethe nge-\u003Cem\u003Ecaesarean section\u003C/em\u003E ehleliweyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EUkucabanga nge-VBAC\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa ufuna ukuzama i-VBAC, kuhle ukukhetha udokotela kumbe umongikazi ozakusekela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkusonto embi nxa kuthatha isikhathi ukuthola abezempilakahle abakulungeleyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkukhetha kwakho isibhedlela kuzabe kuqakathekile ngoba ayisizo zonke izibhedlela eziyenza i-VBAC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUngathola ulwazi olunengi ngokubuza udokotela kumbe umongikazi, ukuya kuma-antenatal classes, kumbe ukukhuluma labanye abesifazane abake babeletha nge-caesarean njalo asebehlela ukubeletha ngendlela yemvelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EInzuzo ze-VBAC\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbesifazane ababeletha ngendlela yemvelo bavame:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkululama masinyane ngemva kokubeletha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungabi lesidingo sokubuyela esibhedlela emasontweni ambalwa ngemva kokubeletha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungabi lesidingo semithi eqinileyo yokunciphisa ubuhlungu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuthola ithuba lokuthinta, ukubamba kanye lokuthintana kwesikhumba lomntwana masinyane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuqalisa lokuqhubeka \u003Cstrong\u003Eukumuyisa ngochago\u003C/strong\u003E kalula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkungabi lenkinga ezinkulu ngesikhathi sokuzithwala esizayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuba lamandla okukhathalela umntwana kanye labanye abantwana.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbesifazane abanengi bathi bazizwa bejabule ngemva kokubeletha ngendlela yemvelo. Abantwana abazalwa ngendlela yemvelo bavame ukuba lamandla amanengi okuzivikela emzimbeni futhi bangabi lama-allergies amanengi. Lokhu kucatshangwa ukuthi kungenxa yama-\u003Cem\u003Ehormone\u003C/em\u003E kanye lama-\u003Cem\u003Ebacteria\u003C/em\u003E aqakathekileye atholakala ngesikhathi sokubeletha ngendlela yemvelo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOkungalunganga okungenzakala nge-VBAC\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInhliziyo yomntwana kanye lokunyakaza kwesibeletho kuzahlolwa ngokunanzelela okukhulu. Lokhu kungadinga imitshina ekhethekileyo engakwenza kube nzima ukuhamba ngesikhathi sokuhelelwa kumbe ukusebenzisa amanzi ukwehlisa ubuhlungu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKukhona ingozi encane yokuthi isibazi esisibelethweni singadabuka ngesikhathi sokubeletha. Lokhu kwenzeka ku-1 kuphela kwabangu-500 abesifazane abenza i-VBAC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa sidabuka, kungaba yingozi kodwa kuvame ukulungiswa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKukhona amathuba amanengi okuthi kube le-\u003Cem\u003Ecaesarean\u003C/em\u003E ephuthumayo nxa umntwana engakhathazeka kumbe nxa umhelo ungathatha isikhathi eside. Lokhu kungabangela ukopha okunengi kumbe ukutheleleka umkhuhlane.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EAmathuba akho okubeletha nge-VBAC\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmathuba akho okubeletha nge-VBAC ancike empilweni yakho kanye lesizathu sokuba le-caesarean ngaphambilini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa wake wabeletha ngendlela yemvelo ngaphambilini kwalokhu njalo wazithwala kungela nhlupho, amathuba akho ayakhuphuka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkusekelwa okuqhubekayo ngesikhathi sokubeletha kungakwenza uzizwe ukhululekile futhi kukhuphule amathuba akho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuya kuma-\u003Cem\u003EVBAC classes \u003C/em\u003Ekungakunceda ukwazi okulindelekileyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkudla okuhle, ukuzuza isisindo esifaneleyo kanye lokwenza imisebenzi lemidlalo eqinisa umzimba ngesikhathi sokuzithwala kuyanceda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAbezempilakahle bavame ukutsho ukuthi ukubelethela esibhedlela kuphephileyo kakhulu, ngoba nxa usesibhedlela amathuba okuthi lapho owasikwa khona ngesikhathi uhlinzwa kuvuleke aba malutshwane. \u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 441,
