            "id": 2266,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Ukwenza i skin to skin  masinya ngemva kokubeletha",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-03-12T10:09:00+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 03/12/2026 - 10:09\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-18T13:05:45+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 08/18/2026 - 13:05\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Ukuthintana komzimba kamama lomntwana   ngemva kokubelethwa kuqakathekile .Kwenza kubelula ukuthi umntwana ajwayele  ukuphila phandle kwesisu,kwakhe ubudlelwano phakathi kukamama lomntwana ,kwenze ukumunyisa kwenzakale masinya.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmama uselapha njalo!\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENgokuthintana lomzimba wakho, umntwana osanda kubelethwa uyakhudumala  njalo   uzizwa ewongekile.  Umntrwana uzwa ilzwi lakho alijwayeleyo kanye lokutshaya kwenhliziyo yakho,  okuyinto aseyijwayele. Ukukhangela emehlweni. Ukukhangelana komntwana lomama  kuyisikhathi  esihle  esiqakatheke kakhulu  ongasoze wasikhohlwa. Isiikhathi lesi esimqoka  senza umama ahle afune ukumunyisa \u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUkuthintana komzimba kamama lomntwana \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUkuthintana komzimba  womntwana lokamama kuyenza bahlaliseke bobabili. kuncede ukuthi inhliziyo yomntwana itshaye ngendlela efaneleyo ,aphefumule kuhle ,kwenze umntwana akhudumale  ngenxa yokukhudumala komzimba kamama/kuncede njalo ukuthi  umzimba womntwana usebenze ngendlela ,lwenze itshukela lomzimba womntwana libe sendaweni eqondileyo,kwenze umntwana engakhali ,kwehlise ukukhathazeka  ,kuncedise ukuthi umntwana athole  ukuvikelela emikhuhlane ngokuthola amagcikwane azayenza umziimba wakhe uzilwele ,.Ukuthintana  komzimba kamama lomntwana kwakha ubudlelwano phakathi kwabo njalo kwenza umntwana adinge masinya ibele ,axhume \u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOkukhuthazwayo\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkuxhumana kufanele kwenziwe ngokuphangisa \u003Cstrong\u003E,\u003C/strong\u003E ngitsho  inkaba ingakaqunywa ,ngokuphangisa kumizuzu  embalwa yokuqala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsikhathi sokuxhumana kufanele sibe lihola elilodwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E Ukuthithana komzimba kamama lomntwana kuyenzeka ngemva kwe \u003Cem\u003ECeasarean Section e\u003C/em\u003Engakulalisi umzimba wonke .  \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa wenziwe i Cesearean Section yokulalisa umzimba wonke , umntwana engathintana umzimba loyise ,  kanye lomama ngemva kokuphapha  (ngamahola ambalwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E Nxa kungamawele, iwele lokuqala lingathintana umzimba  lomama kuze kubelethwe elesibili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E Iyenzwa njani i-skin to skin contant (ukuthintana komzimba kamama lomntwana)\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana  ubekwa  esifubeni sikamama engqgokanga \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana engayesulwa ngaphambi kwalokhu ukuze aqale ukuphefumula lokukhala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana ubekwa  ngesisu phezu kwesisu sikamama, umama  evule izandla,inyawo zehlukene kancane  .\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUmntwana  kufanele agqoke ingowane njalo  ayembeswe ithawulo  kumbe ingubo encane \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAmakhala lomlomo akumelanga kuvalwe, ikhanda lijkhangeliswe  eceleni, intamo iqondile   umntwana ephefumule kuhle.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa ukhathazekile ngokuthi uadinwa ngemva kokubeletha, kufanele wazi ukuthi akula  lutho oluzokuphumuza njalo lukwenze ujabule ngaaphandle  kokuxhumana eduze lomntwana ! Nxa ukhathazekile ngokuthi umntwana  uzalala kufanele wazi ukuthi emaholeni okuqala ngemva kokubelethwa, umntwana osanda kuzalwa uybe ekhangele ,ephapheme njalo ing ukuzwa kwakhe  ukunuka kwezinto kanye lokunambitha  ngokukhaliphileyo , ulungele ukumunya . Nxa ukhathazekile ngempilakahle yomntwana , kufanele wazi ukuthi omongikazi  bayakunakekela ngobuciko wena lomntwana \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E",
            "field_type_of_article": 441,
