            "id": 2001,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Ukumunyisa ngonanzelelo-ukunanzelela izidingo zomntwana ",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-11-13T13:15:13+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EThu, 11/13/2025 - 13:15\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T02:30:24+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 02:30\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Munyisa umntwana nxa esetshengisa ukuthi selambile ungameleli ukuthi aze akhale engasathuliseki. Nanzelela izibonakaliso zokuthi umntwana sefuna ukumunya, amunye lapho afunele khona kungakhathalekile ukuthi ufuna ukumunya nini uchago olunganani njalo  okwesikhathi esingakanani   ",
            "body": "\u003Cp\u003ENxa ungamunyisa  umntwana wakho ngokunanzelela  (hatshi ukuhlela  izikhathi ezithile zokumunyisa) kuyenza ukumunyisa kubelula njalo uchago lwenziwe ngobunengi.Ukumunyisa kwehlisa amathuba wokuba lemikhuhlane ye-jaundice ebantwaneni njalo kwehlisa amathuba okuvuvuka lobuhlungu bamabele  kubomama abamunyisayo.Indlela le yokunanzelela yenza ukumunyisa kuyenzeke kahle  .Munyisa umntwana uchago lukamama kuphela okwenyanga eziyisithupha zakuqala kungela okunye okunathwayo lokudliwayo. Lapho seqale ukuphiwa okunye okudliwayo lokunathwayo ngemva kwenyanga eziyisithupha  , qhubeka umunyisa okweminyaka emibili   kumbe kusedlula.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzibonakaliso zokuthi  umntwana  selambile\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmntwana uyabe engahlalisekanga etshibitshibilikisa ikhanda ,evula  umlomo,ethala thalaza emaceleni,edinga dinga ibele, lezi zindlela zomntwana zokukutshela ukuthi \"sengilambile,ngimunyisa:.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELokhu kulandelwa  yikuzelula loku tshibitshibilika  ngamandla,lokufaka isandla emlonyeni ,okuyisitshengiselo  somntwana sokuthi \"sengilambile kakhulu\"\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUngalindi umntwana aze ekhale engasathuliseki. Umntwaba uyabe esithi \"ngithulisa ube usungimunyisa\". \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuyini okukhangelelwe ukuthi umntwana osanda kuzalwa akwenze ?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAkula mpendulo eyodwa eqondileyo,njengoba abantwana behlukene. Ukuhlala lomntwana ndawonye ngasikhathi sonke esanda kuzalwa kunye lokuthola ukuncediswa ngabezempilakahle ,kunceda ukuthi unanzelele  izibonakaliso zokuthi umntwana sokufanele amunye njalo aphange ukuxhunywa ebeleni\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKumalanga ayisikhombisa okuqala,umntwana uyabe efuna ukuxhunywa ebeleni ngemva kwehola kusiya kumahola amathathu (3),loba nje usenga munya kanengi kulalokhu\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwesinye isikhathi umntwana uyabe efuna ukuxhunywa ebeleni okwesikhathi eside ,okwamahola amanengi,okungenza umama acabange ukuthi akala chago olwaneleyo kumbe kulohlupho ekumunyiseni\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa uchago soluphuma ngendlela kuvamile ukuthi umntwana amunye ka 8  kusiya ku 12  ngelanga \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKwesinye isikhathi umntwana  sengaze eyemunya ngemva kwesikhathi eside kulalokhu okukhuthazwayo \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUkumunyisa ebusuku kuqakathekile ,ikakhulu ngamalanga okuqala ukwenzela ukuthi  uchago lwenziwe ngobunengi nxa umntwana  elokhu exhunywa ebeleni kanengi-nengi\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUsungatshelwa ukuthi ukumunyisa kanengi nengi kungabangela ukudabuka kwengono.Ingono ezibuhlungu kumbe ezidabukileyo zibangelwa yikungaxhumi kuhle umntwana ebeleni hatshi ukumuyisa kanengi nengi kumbe okwesikhathi eside. Umntwana engaxhuma kuhle ebeleni, akusoze kube lohlupho nxa emunya okwesikhathi eside kumbe kanengi.  \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkuvamanga ukuthi umntwana  kube nguye ozithandelayo ukuthi umunya nini njalo uchago olunganani\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa umntwana emunya okwesikhathi eside okungaba phezu kwemizuzu engamatshumi amane (40 minutes),kumbe emunya okwesikhathi esifitshane (okungadluli imizuzu elitshumi (10 minutes)kumbe kanengi nengi okudlula itshumi lambili ngelanga(12 breastfeeds in 24 hours).Nanzelela ukuthi umntwana uxhunywe kuhle  yini ebeleni,kumbe wehlile isisindo somzimba kumbe kulokunye okungahambi kuhle emzimbeni wakhe. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa umntwana elobuthongo or engakwanisi ukuzimunyela ngoba ezelwe insuku zingakakwani,kumbe elesisindo somzimba esiphansi, kumbe ele-\u003Cem\u003Ejaundice\u003C/em\u003E, kuqakathekile ukumncedisa ukufunda ukuxhuma ebeleni kumbe ukumupha uchago ngenkomitsho aze aqine umzimba  akwanise ukuzixhumela ebeleni. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENxa amabele evuvukile kumbe ebuhlungu,vusa umntwana amunye kanengi nengi,lokhu kunceda umntwana kanye lawe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndlela zokuvusa umntwana oleleyo ukuze amunye.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYembula ingubo yomntwana   ukuze enelise ukudlalisa izandla lenyawo kungela okuvimbayo. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMunyisa umntwana uhlezi kahle hatshi ulele. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMbambatha umntwana,ukhuluma laye utshengise uthando ngesikhathi umunyisa \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENxa umntwana elokhu esalele ngemva kokwenza lokhu okuqanjiweyo,zama ukumvusa  njalo ngemva kwe mizuzu engu-30\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVusa kuhle umntwana ungasebenzisi indlela ezingamzwisa ubuhlungu okugoqela ukumncweba izihlathi kumbe ukumtshaya ngaphansi kwenyawo.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E",
